P01.text:
{시작}

Wide shot. A dark, empty studio stage: the edge of a long low platform runs across the lower part of the frame as a thin line of light, the floor below it is in darkness; above, three wide diagonal beams of cold light cut down from the upper left through a faint haze. The man stands small near the middle of the stage, slightly right of centre, his whole body visible and about a quarter of the frame height, facing the camera and stepping slowly forward. He is a near-silhouette: his outline lit by the beams, his face and body in shadow, no facial detail readable.

